config BFLB_PDS
	bool
	help
	  Shared, SoC-agnostic parts of the BFLB PDS deep-sleep support
	  (HBN-RTC/mtimer timekeeping, RC32K calibration policy, gpio-keys
	  wake reporting). Selected by a per-SoC PDS implementation.
